{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100102","id":2723209189,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6iUN_l","number":100102,"title":"Audio bus effects are absent in web export","user":{"login":"DX9T0","id":34134997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTM0OTk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34134997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0","html_url":"https://github.com/DX9T0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DX9T0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2024-12-06T14:36:13Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T15:38:18Z","closed_at":"2024-12-06T15:31:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3.stable.official and 4.4.dev6.official\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot Engine v4.4.dev6 - Compatibility - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f125feb-fa18-4380-aebb-289da242c259\n\n\nAudio effects added to an audio bus do not affect the audio emitting nodes / are missing in web exported projects. The effects function normally in debug and desktop builds, but are missing from web builds. Tested with Reverb, Delay and Phaser audio effects. \n\nTested with just the master bus and also with mutiple audio buses linked together, it doesn't seem to make a difference.\nAlso tested with 2D/3D audio stream player nodes + cameras/listeners, no difference.\n\nAlso same result in Edge, Firefox and Chrome browsers.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project with the Compatibility renderer\n\n2. Make the scene root an AudioStreamPlayer\n\n3. Drag a sound effect into the project, and assign it to the stream property on the AudioStreamPlayer\n\n4. Check the Autoplay box on the AudioStreamPlayer\n\n5. Add the Reverb Effect to the master audio bus\n\n6. Save the scene, run the game and select current as main scene. The effect should work as intended in the debug build\n\n7. Install html5 export template. Build for web, or click remote debug > run in browser. The effect should be missing in the web build\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Missing Audio Effects Web Export.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18039130/Missing.Audio.Effects.Web.Export.zip)\n\nMade with 4.4.dev6 but opens fine in previous 4.x versions","closed_by":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}